msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fun_project/08-fun-Touch_toggle_light.rst:27
msgid "The project involves creating a simple traffic light control mechanism using a touch sensor and a traffic light LED module. When the touch sensor is activated, the LEDs will cycle through the following sequence: Red -> Yellow -> Green."
msgstr ""

