#: ../../source/fun_project/08-fun-Touch_toggle_light.rst:52
msgid "3. Code explanation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fun_project/08-fun-Touch_toggle_light.rst:54
msgid "This project operates on a simple principle: when a touch is detected on the touch sensor, the next LED in the sequence (Red -> Yellow -> Green) will light up. The state of which LED is currently active is managed by the variable ``currentLED``."
msgstr ""

